Article 3

This Regional Regulation aims to: maintain the integrity of the household so that
a. a harmonious family is realized;

prevent violence against women and children;
b. protect and provide a sense of security for women and children;
c. provide services to women and children victims of acts of violence;
d. provide protection to reporters and witnesses; and e. carry out empowerment for women victims of violence.

